      "reason": "Establish a reproducible, efficient causal implementation and assess whether the difficulty rating accounts for numerical behavior and predictor parity.",
      "query": "For SASRec augmented with a gated residual pooling item embeddings using recency and within-prefix TF–IDF cosine recurrence, how can all causal prefix weights be computed in O(L²) rather than O(L³)? Investigate incremental similarity sums, padding and repeated-item handling, truncated-history equivalence, residual norm calibration, near-zero sigmoid gate gradients, and exact training/inference parity."
    },
