      "reason": "Define an evaluation that distinguishes a useful recurrence mechanism from additional capacity and repeated validation tuning.",
      "query": "How should a fixed-budget ablation study evaluate a TF–IDF recurrence residual on SASRec across four Amazon categories using 200 validation users per category and fixed 99-negative HR@10? Investigate baseline, recency-only, uniform-pooling and shuffled-text controls; paired user bootstrap uncertainty; checkpoint and hyperparameter selection bias; and history-length, text-availability and popularity stratification, without accessing test labels or changing the evaluator."
